Scoped rgbashift integer RGB plane shift

The option table, the rgb_pix_fmts negotiation list and the smear and wrap
G, B and R plane index semantics in src/video-ops/rgbashift.ts follow
libavfilter/vf_chromashift.c (rgbasmear_slice8, rgbawrap_slice8, filter_frame,
config_input, rgbashift_options, rgb_pix_fmts).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
